    },
    "summary": "To measure to a **destroyed** model, measure to any point its base covered before it was destroyed. For a model with no base, or a **VEHICLE** model other than a **WALKER** with a base, any part of the model counts.\n\nTo measure to a destroyed unit, measure to the last of its models destroyed.",
